<title>ROMANIA: Romania's 1997 zinc output seen at 28,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Romania's 1997 zinc output seen at 28,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania expects to produce some 28,000 tonnes of zinc this year, slightly up from 27,800 tonnes produced in 1996, the industry ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>January-March zinc output totalled 8,130 tonnes, compared to 7,200 tonnes in the same period last year, ministry data showed.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
